    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sorcerer's Fortitude is a dynamic 3D TPS game where you take on the role of a powerful wizard defending your fortress from relentless waves of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a magical world, learn new spells, and gather resources to unlock unique characters and enhance your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in thrilling battles where every decision you make is of critical importance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through picturesque location, accumulate magical power, and fight a variety of monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy and reaction speed will be your greatest allies in this ongoing battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical artifacts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sorcerer's Fortitude is your chance to become a true wizard, battling against universal evil and defending your magical fortress. Discover the strength and agility within you to overcome all challenges!</p>",
